---
// src/components/bangalore/BangaloreHero.astro
---
<section class="relative bg-amber-50 pt-8 sm:pt-12 lg:pt-16 pb-16 lg:pb-32 overflow-hidden w-full">
  <!-- Background Image with Overlay -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <img 
      src="/images/bangalore_cafe.jpg" 
      alt="Vibrant Bangalore Restaurant Vibe" 
      class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-20"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-amber-50 via-amber-50/80 to-amber-50"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center sm:text-left mt-2 sm:mt-4">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Text Content -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 sm:px-4 sm:py-2 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-600 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm mb-4 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md">
          <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2 shrink-0">
            <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75"></span>
            <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-emerald-500"></span>
          </span>
          <span>For <span class="font-black text-[#e22f28] tracking-tight text-[13px] sm:text-[15px]">Be</span><span class="font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight text-[13px] sm:text-[15px]">ngalur</span><span class="font-black text-[#e22f28] tracking-tight text-[13px] sm:text-[15px]">u</span> restaurants</span>
        </div>
        
        <h1 class="text-[32px] leading-[1.1] sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4 lg:mb-6">
          One payment a week. <br/>
          <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-600 to-rose-500">Nobody checks it.</span>
        </h1>
        
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl text-slate-700 font-semibold mb-2 sm:mb-4 leading-snug sm:leading-relaxed">
          Thousands of Swiggy and Zomato orders go into that one number.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl text-slate-700 font-semibold mb-4 sm:mb-4 leading-snug sm:leading-relaxed">
          Commission, discounts, ad charges, penalties. All cut before it reaches your bank.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl text-slate-900 font-bold mb-5 sm:mb-8 leading-snug sm:leading-relaxed bg-white/60 p-3 sm:p-4 rounded-xl border border-orange-200/50 backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm">
          Send us one month. We find what was charged wrongly and get it back.
        </p>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 sm:gap-4 items-center sm:items-start justify-center sm:justify-start">
          <a href="#free-check" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex justify-center items-center px-6 py-3.5 sm:px-8 sm:py-4 text-base sm:text-lg font-black rounded-xl text-slate-900 bg-[#25D366] hover:bg-[#1DA851] transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-xl shadow-[#25D366]/30">
            Get my free check
          </a>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 font-bold mt-2 sm:mt-4 bg-orange-100/50 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-orange-200/50">
            Free for the next 20 restaurants.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Image/Visual Content -->
      <div class="relative w-full mt-8 lg:mt-0">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-orange-400 to-rose-400 rounded-3xl blur-3xl opacity-30 animate-pulse"></div>
        <img 
          src="/images/bangalore_dosa.jpg" 
          alt="Bangalore Restaurant Dosa" 
          class="relative rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border-4 border-white w-full object-cover h-[350px] sm:h-[400px] lg:h-[500px]"
        />
        <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -left-2 sm:-left-6 sm:-bottom-6 bg-white p-4 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-slate-100">
          <p class="text-slate-500 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm mb-1 uppercase tracking-wide">Recovered this month</p>
          <p class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-orange-600">₹42,500+</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
